export anchor DatabaseConsole:
    description:
        Brightwork Data, a made-up database console, connected to
        production-replica, a read-only Postgres-style database.

    schemaTree:
        Tables projects, tasks, members, activity and invoices, with tasks
        expanded to show id, project_id, title, assignee_id, due_on and status.

    query:
        A query editor holding a SELECT that counts open tasks per project
        where due_on is before today, grouped by project and ordered by the
        count, descending.

    results:
        - Billing migration, 2
        - Mobile app 2.0, 1
        - Website redesign, 1
        The run took 38 ms and returned 3 rows.

    history:
        - 09:41, count overdue tasks, 38 ms
        - 09:30, members without tasks, 12 ms
        - 09:12, a failed query with the error column assignee does not exist

    status:
        Read-only replica, lag 2 seconds, 14 active connections.
